title: $:/mf/gen/CLI command/mf task show
catalog: CLI command
target: mf task show
summary: Show a single background task by id (or stop it with --stop)

!! Reference

```
Show a single background task by id (or stop it with --stop)

Usage: mf task show [OPTIONS] <ID>

Arguments:
  <ID>
          

Options:
      --stop
          Request cancellation of the task instead of showing it (doc "Cancelling a task")

      --json
          Print the raw JSON object

  -h, --help
          Print help
```
